{"path":"chrono/zoned_time/operator=","title":"std::chrono::zoned_time<Duration,TimeZonePtr>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::zoned_time&lt;Duration,TimeZonePtr&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/zoned_time/operator=","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Assign the value of other to *this.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">zoned_time<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> zoned_time<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw1\">default</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">zoned_time<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/system_clock\"><span class=\"kw2641\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sys_time</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Duration<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">zoned_time<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/local_t\"><span class=\"kw2638\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">local_time</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Duration<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Assign the value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Defaulted copy assignment operator. Copy-assigns both the stored time point and the stored time zone pointer. <code>zoned_time</code> has no move assignment operator; a move is a copy.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Assigns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> to the stored time point. The time zone pointer is unchanged. After this call, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">get_sys_time<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> other</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Converts <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> to a <span class=\"t-lc\">std::chrono::sys_time</span> as if by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">zone<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>to_sys<span class=\"br0\">(</span>other<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> (where <code>zone</code> is the non-static data member holding the stored time zone pointer) and assigns the result to the stored time point. The time zone pointer is unchanged. After this call, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">get_local_time<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> other</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value </h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/zoned_time","title":"std::chrono::zoned_time"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::zoned_time<Duration,TimeZonePtr>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Assign the value of other to *this."},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":131,"codeBlockCount":0}
